  "reflectionText": "Sanballat and Geshem sent to Nehemiah four times, asking him to come down to the plain of Ono. Nehemiah answered the same way each time: I am doing a great work, so that I cannot come down. Why should the work cease while I leave it? Have you ever been asked to come down from the work the Lord has put in your hands, by people who only meant to harm you?"
